P3-SCALE-001 RED

Command:
  rtk git show HEAD:docker-compose.yml | python3 -c 'import sys; text=sys.stdin.read(); print("container_name: present" if "container_name:" in text else "container_name: absent"); raise SystemExit(1 if "container_name:" in text else 0)'

Observed:
  container_name: present

Root cause exposed:
  The base Compose topology used fixed container identities, so host scripts and smoke checks could not safely address scaled replicas through service discovery.
